at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-03-27T05:48:38Z","updated_at":"2025-05-20T00:46:13Z","closed_at":"2025-05-19T21:34:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104682","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104682.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104682.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-19T21:34:03Z"},"body":"While working on my 4D module, I tried to make it very comfy to use, including having docs and icons for everything. There are a few things I made icons for which their 2D and 3D equivalents in the base engine don't have. This PR adds them.\r\n\r\nLeft: Icons in master.\r\nMiddle: Icons that were in this PR when it first opened.\r\nRight: Updated icons thanks to the recommendations from @MewPurPur.\r\n\r\n![new_icons](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2de707be-805f-4d13-b272-0df2ca518a11)\r\n\r\nFrom top to bottom:\r\n- Geometry2D/3D: Inspired by drafting triangles. Can also be interpreted as getting the length of something.\r\n- KinematicCollision2D/3D: Depicts 2 boxes hitting each other, including \"sparks\" for effect.\r\n- CollisionObject2D/3D: Includes the outer ring of StaticBody2D/3D and the inner square of Area2D/3D.\r\n- PhysicsBody2D/3D: Like CollisionObject2D/3D but includes the lines from AnimatableBody2D/3D.\r\n    - Note: CollisionObject2D/3D and PhysicsBody2D/3D are abstract node types, so the icon uses the abstract node color defined in `editor_color_map.cpp`.\r\n    - Note: The 2D abstract color wasn't used in master prior to this PR.\r\n- Shape2D/3D: Previously just the ObjectDisabled icon, now is colored to match the dimension.\r\n    - Note: The individual 3D shapes are currently colored blue, which is a bit odd. I didn't change those.\r\n- World2D/3D: Color to match dimension, and replace the \"paper\" icon of World2D to match 3D.\r\n    - This one may be controversial because of the World2D change, but I think the circle and dot representing a planet and moon is a better icon for \"world\". The paper makes me think of CanvasLayer or something.\r\n\r\nWhen I initially opened this PR, all of these just used the same colors as 2D/3D nodes, but some contributors below expressed that this is not desired. They now have a different set of colors which are slightly different, and these new colors have been added to `editor_color_map.cpp` as well.\r\n\r\nAll icons in the above image are the dark theme version. They look good in light theme too:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"150\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-05-12 at 6 19 22 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd50e5fd-26f6-4732-b481-4700399dcdd9\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104682/reactions","total_count":30,"+1":22,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":3,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104682/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}